+From: Karin-Laboratory contributors
+Subject: [RFC] arm64: dts: mediatek: add partial MT6990 research tree
+
+Compile independently transcribed CPU, PSCI, GICv3, architected timer and
+disabled peripheral observations as a non-bootable research DTB. Document the
